# Scoring / co-play (domain)

## Non-negotiables

- Crossing a threshold creates a **pending suggestion**, never an auto-promote
- Council / Prophet are never suggestion targets from points
- Threshold numbers live only in `Data/Ranks.lua`
- Cities / open-world loops grant **nothing**

## Sources (V1)

| Source | Counts when | Intent |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| Shared instance | Dungeon / raid / BG with ≥1 **guildmate** in party/raid | Capped drip + completion bonus |
| Ceremony | Officer starts; credit on clean close | Medium flat grant |
| Beef Gora | Challenge → recorded win/loss/draw | Win > draw > loss; **losses still pay** |

Guildmates need not run the addon for local co-play credit.

## Anti-abuse (locked intent)

- **Anti-AFK:** instance bucket pays only if the player entered combat in that bucket
- Per-day caps per source (especially instance drip)
- Completion bonus is best-effort — Classic dungeon-complete signals can be flaky
- Officer manual adjust/wipe remains the correction tool

## Suggestion boundary

```text
points accrue locally → MaybeSuggest (next point-driven rank only)
                     → officer Approve/Reject
                     → Commit / RANK_COMMIT
```

Reject clears suggestion; standing remains unless officer corrects.

## Pacing

A new member’s first full dungeon night with guildmates should be able to earn Fresh → Cooked eligibility.
